Parts of this crate are ports of lottie-web
(https://github.com/airbnb/lottie-web, commit
bede03d25d232826e0c9dca1733d542d8a7754fb), MIT License, Copyright (c)
2015 Bodymovin; the licence is reproduced in LICENSE-lottie-web.txt:

- src/geom.rs: the rectangle, ellipse, star and polygon path builders
  (player/js/utils/shapes/ShapeProperty.js);
- src/modifiers.rs: trim paths, round corners, pucker/bloat, zig-zag and
  offset path (player/js/utils/shapes/*Modifier.js, bez.js,
  PolynomialBezier.js);
- src/shapes.rs: the repeater transform steps (RepeaterModifier.js);
- src/text/: text layout, animators and range selectors
  (player/js/utils/text/*, FontManager.js);
- src/effects.rs: effect parameter semantics
  (player/js/elements/svgElements/effects/*).

Changes: translated from JavaScript to Rust, adapted to the eUI display
list (paths and layers instead of SVG/Canvas calls), and made
deterministic (no Math.random).

The design of the display-list RenderSink follows velato
(https://github.com/linebender/velato, Apache-2.0 OR MIT); no velato code
is included.
